# jni/prebuild: upstream commits the static archives its build_*.sh scripts
# produce (17 per ABI) plus the ABI-dependent ffmpeg headers. F-Droid cannot
# ship binaries it did not build, so we run those same scripts over the pinned
# submodules and treat everything they write as generated.
